      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2173,
       "endIndex": 2285,
       "text": "| **Sign-On Bonus** | $0 | **$75,000 \u2013 $100,000** | Offsets leaving Meta mid-cycle and bridges transition risk"
