      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2289,
       "endIndex": 2410,
       "text": "| **Equity (RSUs)** | $1,080,000 / 4 yrs | **$1,200,000 / 4 yrs** | Strengthens total comp and cushions the Year 3/4 drop"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3189,
       "endIndex": 3315,
       "text": "*To bridge the unvested equity and bonus timing I\u2019d forfeit at Meta, I would need a **sign-on bonus of $75,000 to $100,000**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3323,
       "endIndex": 3446,
       "text": "*To ensure strong total comp continuity through Years 3 and 4, I'd like to see the initial equity grant bumped to **$1.2M**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3539,
